      "title": "Adjunct Clinical Nursing Faculty - NURS 412",
      "description": "Adjunct Clinical Nursing Faculty - NURS 412 You need to enable JavaScript to run this app. Careers Sign In Create Account Adjunct Clinical Nursing Faculty - NURS 412 Misenheimer Campus - Misenheimer, NC 28109 Apply Overview Position Type Adjunct Education Level MSN Degree Category Education Apply Description Clinical Adjunct faculty will supervise students in Psych / Mental Health clinical rotations. Position will be for fall 2022 semester. Psych/Mental Health settings in clinical agencies. Duties and Responsibilities: Supervise and teach students in clinical settings and assist with on campus simulation days for clinical group. Qualifications Experience in mental health nursing. MSN degree. Teaching experience preferred. Must have a current unrestricted NC or compact nursing license. Must meet clinical agency compliance standards. Terms of Use | Privacy Policy | © 2026 Paycom | All Rights Reserved. X This website uses cookies to customize and improve your experience. If you are a California resident, you may be entitled to certain rights regarding your personal information. Additional information about our data collection practices and location specific notices is available on our privacy policy. Accept Cookies"
